KEY             STL=STALEMATE (NEITHER SIDE CAN BEAT THE OTHER; THE STRANGERS HOLD THE AREA)  CAP=ROUND CAP REACHED
KEY  COLUMN     SCN#=SCENARIO (JSON id)  DCK=DECK  LVL=DUNGEON LEVEL  CRS=CURSES ON THE PARTY  EYE=EYE OF GOD PRESENT  ATK=WHO ATTACKS (S STRANGERS, P PARTY)
KEY             SUP=THE ATTACKER'S ROUND 1 SURPRISE (0 TO 2)  NP=PARTY SIZE  NS=NUMBER OF STRANGERS  END=HOW THE FIGHT ENDED  RDS=ROUNDS  PAL=PARTY SURVIVORS  SAL=STRANGER SURVIVORS
KEY             PVL=PARTY VALUE LOST (VP)  SVL=STRANGER VALUE LOST (VP)  R1=SHARE OF ROUND 1 MATCHES THE STRANGERS WON  R2=1 IF STRANGERS WIN, PARTY RETREATS OR STALEMATE
KEY             R3=VALUE DESTROYED MINUS LOST, 0 TO 1  SEED=SCENARIO AND DICE SEED
